# A FOUR-PLAYER game for iomoon, at the country default (4, Netherlands, English, F11).
# Every other capture in this corpus plays one player, so the whole multi-player side of
# the machine has never been on screen: PLAYER 2, 3 and 4 in the in-play HUD, the
# player-to-player handover at each drain, and the four-player end of game.  The ROM
# carries PLAYER 1: .. PLAYER 4: as real strings (JUGADOR 1: .. 4: in Spanish); only
# PLAYER 1 has ever been decoded from a capture.
#
# Four players need four credits.  A coin only sticks after the first attract cycle, and
# one coin is not one credit under country 4's coin preset (F11): six coins buy one, so
# twenty-four are pressed here and START is taken four times, once per player, before the
# first ball is plunged.
#
# Each of the twelve balls is the same shape -- plunge, two lane hits so the ball scores,
# drain, follow the next ball -- which keeps the walk short enough to read while still
# giving every player its own ball-start, in-play and drained screens on all three balls.
#
# Keys: 5 coin, 1 start, Space plunge, Q drain, Down follow the next ball, Y/U lanes 1/2.
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  6641 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6701 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6761 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6821 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6881 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6941 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
